From bc5dce04b7eb28b11a621586e6c09b541551b9c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:42:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0181: OPTIONS has NEW DIGIMON (ON by default). OFF
 keeps the partner to the species the original game raises (DIGI.DAT's vanilla
 bitmap, SPECIES_HEADER_VANILLA, isVanillaSpecies; modSpeciesAllowed at every
 evolution choice: Fresh, In-Training and its extras, Rookie,
 Champion/Ultimate, the Ultimate rules, the new evolution items), and the
 chart is the original sheet (renderEvoChartViewVanilla, chartVanillaInput)
 with trees of the original rows (chartEvolutionPath). Byte 6 of
 SAVE_TAG_OPTIONS

